# Veteran Guardmouse: "Valiant - Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability you control for the first time
# each turn, it gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Scry 1." Turn 3: the Basilisk Collar's equip targets it first:
# it gets +1/+0 and first strike (the Collar gives deathtouch and lifelink too) and Bot1 scries 1, sending the Forest on top of the
# library to the bottom (the second Forest below it is then on top). Rancor, a spell targeting it again the same turn, is the second
# time: no further +1/+0, no second scry. Turn 5: the turn-3 Forest was drawn, the +1/+0 and first strike have ended (CR 514.2) and
# the trigger is available again - the scry now looks at the Island on top and keeps it there (the empty bottom group).

